- Bezdek, Keller, Krishnapuram, Kuncheva, Pal (1999). Will the real iris data please stand up? *IEEE Trans. Fuzzy Systems* 7(3):368–369. doi:10.1109/91.771092 — copy differences.
- Vanschoren, van Rijn, Bischl, Torgo (2014). OpenML: networked science in machine learning. *SIGKDD Explorations* 15(2):49–60. doi:10.1145/2641190.2641198 — data source.
- Cover & Hart (1967). Nearest neighbor pattern classification. *IEEE Trans. Inf. Theory* 13(1):21–27. doi:10.1109/TIT.1967.1053964 — k-NN.
- Dietterich (1998). Approximate statistical tests for comparing supervised classification learning algorithms. *Neural Computation* 10(7):1895–1923. doi:10.1162/089976698300017197.
- Nadeau & Bengio (2003). Inference for the generalization error. *Machine Learning* 52(3):239–281. doi:10.1023/A:1024068626366 — corrected resampled t.
- Bouckaert & Frank (2004). Evaluating the replicability of significance tests for comparing learning algorithms. PAKDD 2004, LNCS 3056:3–12. doi:10.1007/978-3-540-24775-3_3 — corrected repeated k-fold CV test.
- Varma & Simon (2006). Bias in error estimation when using cross-validation for model selection. *BMC Bioinformatics* 7:91. doi:10.1186/1471-2105-7-91 — nested CV.
- Bates, Hastie & Tibshirani (2024). Cross-validation: what does it estimate and how well does it do it? *JASA* 119(546):1434–1445. doi:10.1080/01621459.2023.2197686 — CV intervals.
